OL,3,GNEWSATwo women in hospital after
OL,4,Asuspected arson attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo people have been taken to hospital
OL,7,Fafter a fire at a house which police
OL,8,Fare investigating as arson.
OL,10,FThe women escaped with minor injuries
OL,11,Ffrom an address on Greenlee Garth in
OL,12,FNewton Aycliffe but remain at
OL,13,FDarlington Memorial Hospital.
OL,15,FDurham Police said no-one else was
OL,16,Finjured but neighbouring houses were
OL,17,Fdamaged.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,392,390,260,160,0,100
