OL,3,GNEWSATwo women in hospital after
OL,4,Asuspected arson attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for County Durham and
OL,7,FDarlington Fire and Rescue Service
OL,8,F(CDDFRS) said: "On arrival, crews were
OL,9,Ffaced with a well-developed fire
OL,10,Finvolving the property and roof space,
OL,11,Fwhich had spread into neighbouring
OL,12,Fhomes."
